  "solution": {
    "text": "Chemical pollutants in photochemical smog are nitrogen oxides (NO and  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> ), volatile organic compounds, ozone  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> , peroxyacetyl nitrates.<br/><br/>In the presence of sunlight of the following reactions take place<br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/>Hence, it consists of excessive amount of ozone melecules.",
